  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the tandoor to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Slice the tandoor bread into 1-inch pieces and toast until lightly browned.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the jam and maple syrup until well combined.",
    "Arrange the toasted bread pieces in the earthenware bowl.",
    "Place the vegan cheese slices on top of the bread pieces.",
    "Drizzle the jam and maple syrup mixture over the cheese slices.",
    "Drizzle the olive oil over the top of the cheese slices.",
    "Sprinkle the salt and black pepper over the top of the cheese slices.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
